      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Point Biomedical Corp is developing PB-127 (CardioSphere) as an ultrasound imaging agent for assessing myocardial perfusion in patients with coronary artery disease. In January 2006, the company submitted an NDA for the agent; this was accepted for review in February 2006, with a Prescription Drug User Fee Act review and action date of late October 2006. PB-127 is effective for intermittent harmonic power Doppler imaging and may be the first contrast agent to receive FDA approval for myocardial perfusion imaging."},
